<h2 id="create-a-source-connector">1. Create a source connector</h2>
<p>We'll pull orders from Postgres. See <a href="{{cms:item/7418c3d6-9ea1-4d1c-8d8f-73136f6b6abb}}">Connectors</a> for the full catalog of types.</p>

